WEBVTT

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.620
War.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.700
Yes, war never changes, in any era.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.000
The age of discovery.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.750
Humanity set sail into the oceans
with adventure in their hearts.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:31.080
But soon, those hearts were filled by
a different desire, to conquer the seas.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:37.330
However, the true enemy appeared
from outside the world.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:54.830
The Sirens.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.700
With their vastly superior technologies,

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:06.040
the Sirens easily pushed
humanity out of the oceans.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.290
There was no longer any place
in the seas for mankind.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.660
To counter this unprecedented threat,

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:16.540
humanity organized a global
alliance named Azur Lane.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:21.040
Together, they fought valiantly
against the Sirens.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.830
Central to the formation of this grand alliance
were the four major camps--

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:27.290
Eagle Union,

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:28.790
Royal Navy,

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:30.330
Iron Blood,

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.790
and Sakura Empire.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:44.540
After a desperate struggle, the Azur Lane
finally repelled the Siren onslaught.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.910
Time passed...

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.950
"Waters adjacent to
Eagle Union homeland"

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:04.540
"Repair Ship Vestal"

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.540
All ready to depart?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:10.500
This could be a major battle.
Please be careful.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:16.080
There is only one thing
we must learn from history.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.040
"Aircraft Carrier Enterprise"

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:26.450
War never changes, regardless of era.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.870
"Newly constructed Azur Lane base"

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.450
Wow, it's gotten really exciting around here!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.450
"Light Cruiser Cleveland"

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.580
"Battleship Prince of Wales"

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:17.370
Forces from both Eagle Union and Royal Navy
are gathering at this base.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:17.370
Welcome! Take a look at our bunny-rific flowers!

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:20.120
It's only going to get busier from here on.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.000
You know who else is coming from my side?

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.830
It's Eagle Union's greatest warrior,
given the most battle stars ever!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.250
The famous Grey Ghost, yes...

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:36.580
The main forces of us Royal Navy
are also arriving soon.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:41.250
This base will surely become central
to all of our ongoing activities.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.370
Well then, we'd better greet them properly!

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:46.410
Can't keep them waiting. Let's go!

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:50.790
Come on, hurry!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.160
Don't rush me.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.450
Oh...

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.450
"Destroyer Ayanami"

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:09.120
"Aircraft Carrier Illustrious"

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.120
Illustrious!

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:18.620
Your Highness, coming out to greet me?
To what do I owe that honor?

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.450
Please don't tease.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:23.040
Long time no see, Illustrious.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:27.580
Good day, Prince of Wales.
Who is your friend?

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:32.330
Cleveland, from Eagle Union! Glad to see
you've made it through your long journey.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.700
"Light Aircraft Carrier Unicorn"

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.750
Um...

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:46.620
This is Unicorn. I'm sorry, she's a tad shy.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.870
I hope you weren't offended.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.000
Nice to meet you!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.830
"Azur Lane Academy"

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.250
Hood and the others will join shortly.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:00.790
Shouldn't we be keeping an eye
on Iron Blood? How is that faring?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:06.290
A temporary lull, for lack of a better description.
What's more pressing is...

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.200
Sakura Empire, as we suspected.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.330
If Sakura Empire is making a move,

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:15.330
this base would be one of the hottest fronts.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.870
Reinforcing this base is a natural decision.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.410
Why wage such meaningless conflict...

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:26.580
Warfare never changes,
no matter what era we are in.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:30.290
It's the reason we all were
brought into existence...

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.250
Um...

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.580
"Destroyer Javelin"

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.500
Oh, you must be... Um...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.870
I'm Javelin! You're from
the Royal Navy, too, right?

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.330
Is something wrong?

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.950
Unicorn got separated from her U- <i>chan</i> ...

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.250
"U- <i>chan</i> "...?

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.700
Unicorn's friend... What should I do...?

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.250
Hmm...

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.910
I get it!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.790
You and I can find U- <i>chan</i> together!

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:08.250
"Destroyer Laffey"

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.250
Warm...

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:11.000
Um, excuse me?

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.750
Hmm...?

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:15.000
Have you seen U- <i>chan</i> ?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.660
She got separated from her friend.
Have you seen anything?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.830
Good skills.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.910
Look familiar?

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.790
Hmm...

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.830
Sleepy.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:34.330
Oh, sorry to bother you during your rest!

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.200
Okay, on to the next!

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.700
You in trouble?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.950
Hmm?

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.950
Laffey will help, too.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:58.200
♪ Let's be cheerful, altogether now! ♪

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.450
♪ I'm number one! ♪

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.620
Yay!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.410
A stuffed animal...?

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:35.040
A strange creature.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.330
U- <i>chan</i> !

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:43.540
There you are, U- <i>chan</i> ! I'm so glad...

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.540
U- <i>chan</i> .

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.870
Thank you!

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:51.160
No, I didn't do anything to deserve thanks.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:57.000
I didn't know such a pretty place existed!

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:07.080
The wind feels nice... Nodding off...

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:11.080
How did you find such a great spot?
You must have skills!

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.790
Um... Thanks.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.370
Oh, I'm Javelin!

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:16.870
Laffey.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.370
Unicorn.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:24.080
Thank you for finding our friend!
Can I ask your name?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.750
Um...

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.660
A bird?

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:39.080
That was startling... Huh?

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.040
Ayanami reporting.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.790
We're on mission. Use your code name.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.790
Oh... Sorry. This is "Citrus."

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:55.790
I have a general understanding
of the structure of the base.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:10:00.000
Good. We're ready to take action as well.
Rendezvous when appropriate.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.290
Understood.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.580
"Phoenix," ready when you are.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.540
"Aircraft Carrier Akagi"

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:13.500
Kaga, what, do you suppose,
is the fundamental nature of battle?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.450
"Aircraft Carrier Kaga"

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:17.160
Um, my dear sister Akagi,
please use the code name...

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.750
To battle is to inflict injury.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.120
To battle is to receive injury.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.700
A battle is a mutual exchange of pain.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:33.080
Through pain, we understand each other's feelings.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:36.290
In other words, to battle means to love.

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:47.250
I don't fully understand what you are saying.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.040
I will destroy my enemies. That is all.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.870
Oh, how apathetic of you.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:09.500
Now... Let's start this war.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.910
The Sirens?!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.580
Intercept them, hurry! This is not a drill!

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:15.620
Understood!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:25.870
The Sirens, now? What a terrible timing...

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.830
Is it by chance? Or...

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.080
Could it be...?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.950
Cleveland, knight of the seas...

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.700
Entering battle!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.540
How's that?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:10.330
The ultimate weapon humanity
developed to combat you Sirens...

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:24.580
That's us, with the power of warships
embedded into our bodies!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:41.080
The power to defeat you!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.950
Javelin, going in full-power!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.290
Conditions green... Let's go.

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.040
Yes!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:14.950
Yes, we were created
by humanity to fight the Sirens...

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:21.250
But a difference in beliefs split
the four major camps into two factions.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:28.660
One faction restricts itself to using
only powers created by humankind.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.830
That's you, Eagle Union and Royal Navy.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.830
The other faction is...

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.040
That emblem...

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:42.830
The faction that will use Siren
technology to defeat the Sirens.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:45.700
Iron Blood, and us, Sakura Empire.

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:02.750
Sakura Empire 1st Carrier Division, Akagi.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:05.120
Sakura Empire 1st Carrier Division, Kaga.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:06.660
Behold and tremble!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.000
There's no end to this!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.950
We could be in trouble.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.700
Interceptors?!

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.950
Don't bully my friends!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.580
That girl, she's an aircraft carrier.

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.500
Such a lean body, she's not much of a meal...

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.120
But a prey is a prey.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.660
I shall devour you!

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:27.040
Not on my watch!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.290
Watch out!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.660
Laffey!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.870
Laffey... Still combat capable.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.450
You...!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:54.160
Sakura Empire, improved
Fubuki-class destroyer Ayanami...

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.700
Taste the power of the Demon...!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.580
But why...

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:10.250
We are enemies, of course!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:39.910
Is that it? Was I a fool to expect a challenge?

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.660
Oh, Kaga, you're enjoying this.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:03.410
Please! If you continue, Unicorn will...

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:24.700
Stop!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:35.790
What?!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.500
That ship...

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:52.330
An Eagle Union aircraft carrier...
Is that who I think it is?

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:05.160
That's her! That's Eagle Union's
strongest aircraft carrier...!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:08.450
The Grey Ghost, the Great E...!

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.120
So it's you!

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:18.290
Enterprise... engage!

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:38.000
Here I come.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.870
Interesting!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.250
Incredible...

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:41.750
Entertain me, phantom!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.080
Wait, Kaga!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.250
You...

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.450
You're mine.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.290
Kaga!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:14.120
How dare you injure my body!
This body belongs to my dear sister!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.660
Enough, Kaga.

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:22.370
Dear sister! I can still fight!

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:25.830
I know. But there's a right time for everything.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:34.120
Big sister!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.500
Sheesh, someone's late.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:42.080
We've accomplished our goals, mostly.
This mission is a success.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:45.830
Yes, dear sister. If you say so.

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:47.370
You think we're going to let you get away?

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:53.200
Oh, what a scary glare.
I'm about to lose my composure.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:11.290
"Aircraft Carrier Zuikaku"

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:11.290
My seniors, it's time.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.160
Yes, let us take our leave.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:18.330
Wait!

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:41.160
Azur Lane, consider this
a formal declaration of war.

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:47.160
We, Sakura Empire, along with Iron Blood,
will now crush your deception.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:50.750
The mighty must control the future.

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:56.500
Heaven's will resides with us,
the true conqueror of the seas.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:22:02.160
We are the alliance of crimson blood...
We are Red Axis.

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:06.080
They got away...

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:09.950
She really saved us.

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:14.660
Enterprise, the mightiest
warrior of Eagle Union...

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:18.410
But there is so much pain...

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:26.330
One battle after another...
